      "writtenOn": "2020-01-09T08:23:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I also commented on b/145965256.\n\nDrm vts requires a corresponding vendor vts module for each scheme. If the WV vendor vts module is found at the specified location (/data/local/tmp) drm vts would attempt to test the module. The WV vendor vts module is shared between vts versions, so it was likely built/pushed by earlier drm vts versions.\n\nWe can avoid this if we have access to some parameter passed in from the vts runner instructing which hal to test.",
      "parentUuid": "dd3dc529_37c724fe",
